  lines:
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: Please.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 86a900989a1394240a11d11c992bd539, type: 3}
    text: No.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: Please please.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 86a900989a1394240a11d11c992bd539, type: 3}
    text: Still no.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9206739d0fdeb04a93e48371b1f0a65, type: 3}
    text: Please please please.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 787fafedeaa52fc4a96a9263c592c76e, type: 3}
    text: Are you just going to keep saying please?
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 674f535e9e647f045bcecace432618c2, type: 3}
    text: Yes
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5be961f9a5bb06b4d95efb058e8ee00f, type: 3}
    text: Honestly, he can do this for hours.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36d07941ce46d5347839b5f70bf36094, type: 3}
    text: You are supposed to be on my side.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8ae8ad4b19d4d245815a4d418701c43, type: 3}
    text: I am on the side of whoever makes this scene end faster.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: Please.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 787fafedeaa52fc4a96a9263c592c76e, type: 3}
    text: Fine. Whatever. Make your wish.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9206739d0fdeb04a93e48371b1f0a65, type: 3}
    text: Really?
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 787fafedeaa52fc4a96a9263c592c76e, type: 3}
    text: Before I change my mind.
